{"sections":[{"title":"Swift Package Discovery Tutorial","action":{"isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"Get started","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"Get started","type":"text"}],"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies"},"kind":"hero","image":"ic_unified_ds.png","backgroundImage":"ic_unified_ds.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Discovering a new framework can be exciting and scary. Learn how you can embed and use OUDS Swift Package.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"With this tutorial you will learn fundamental concepts of Orange Unified Design System and discover the layers of this framework.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Theme, components, tokens… everything will be introduced!","type":"text"}]}]},{"image":null,"content":[],"kind":"volume","name":null,"chapters":[{"tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies"],"name":"Import of the Swift Package and choose its librairies","image":"ic_unified_ds.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this chapter you will learn how to import the OUDS iOS Swift Package and which librairies it provides"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you should choose for your needs."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme"],"name":"Preparation of the theme","image":"ic_theme_intro.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this chapter you will see how to instanciate a theme and inject it inside your app"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components"],"name":"Use of first components provided by OUDS","image":"ic_component_intro.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this chapter you will see how you can use your first components provided by OUDS Swift Package"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components"],"name":"Richer and more original components of OUDS","image":"ic_component_intro.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this chapter you will use original components of OUDS and richer ones"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things"],"name":"Typography, view modifiers and tokens","image":"ic_design_token_intro.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS is not only about components and themes. It provides view modifiers, typographies and tokens which can be used. You will learn how."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further"],"name":"Go further with more ressources","image":"ic_unified_ds.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can have questions and issues, and there are resources online. Let’s see that together."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"overview","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)"},"metadata":{"category":"Orange Unified Design System","role":"overview","estimatedTime":"2hr 5min","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","title":"Swift Package Discovery Tutorial"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)"]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things":{"kind":"project","abstract":[{"t