 a new framework can be exciting and scary. Learn how you can embed and use OUDS Swift Package."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"With this tutorial you will learn fundamental concepts of Orange Unified Design System and discover the layers of this framework.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Theme, components, tokens… everything will be introduced!"}],"title":"Swift Package Discovery Tutorial","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","role":"overview"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components":{"kind":"project","abstract":[{"text":"Components can be similar to iOS native components, or can also be original and strongly related to Orange Unified Design System needs.","type":"text"}],"role":"project","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","estimatedTime":"30min","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","type":"topic","title":"Add more OUDS components"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies":{"role":"project","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies","kind":"project","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies","estimatedTime":"10min","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS iOS is exposed through an open source Swift Package hosted on GitHub, and provides several librairies for your needs."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"These librairies help to split products and make users able to select only what they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"SwiftUI is the only official supported framework for Apple platforms.","type":"text"}],"title":"Swift Package integration","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components":{"kind":"project","abstract":[{"text":"OUDS provides components ready to be used, specified in Figma assets and preventing users to handle tokens.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"They are rendered thanks to the theme in use.","type":"text"}],"role":"project","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components","estimatedTime":"30min","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components","type":"topic","title":"Use your first OUDS components"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme":{"kind":"project","abstract":[{"text":"The theme is exposed as one object which will be injected inside your SwiftUI view.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The theme provides all tokens which defines in the end the rendering of everything.","type":"text"}],"role":"project","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","estimatedTime":"15min","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme","type":"topic","title":"Instanciate and inject a theme"}}}